1
00:00:01,145 --> 00:00:03,629
Every corner shop in Asia keeps a ledger.

2
00:00:03,679 --> 00:00:05,529
Almost no lender can read it.

3
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:08,086
Meet Sunita Sharma.

4
00:00:08,136 --> 00:00:12,324
She has run a kirana in Kothrud, Pune, for eleven years.

5
00:00:12,374 --> 00:00:15,793
Three weeks before Diwali, she needs ₹80,000 for stock.

6
00:00:15,843 --> 00:00:17,334
The bank says no.

7
00:00:17,384 --> 00:00:19,261
No records, no credit score.

8
00:00:19,311 --> 00:00:21,573
So she turns to the moneylender.

9
00:00:22,623 --> 00:00:24,477
But Sunita does have records.

10
00:00:24,527 --> 00:00:27,523
Every sale, every supplier, every rupee of credit,

11
00:00:27,573 --> 00:00:29,047
handwritten in her khata.

12
00:00:29,097 --> 00:00:32,855
From kiranas in India to sari-sari stores in the Philippines,

13
00:00:32,905 --> 00:00:36,282
millions of shops are invisible for the same reason.

14
00:00:36,332 --> 00:00:38,186
Checking them takes lenders days,

15
00:00:38,236 --> 00:00:40,852
and one edited document can fool them.

16
00:00:43,302 --> 00:00:44,385
This is Kosha.

17
00:00:44,435 --> 00:00:46,650
In the Arthashastra, kosha means treasury.

18
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:49,670
Kosha turns the records a shop already keeps

19
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:52,690
into a credit passport any lender can trust.

20
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:57,373
Sunita photographs three pages of her khata.

21
00:00:57,423 --> 00:01:00,325
Gemini reads every handwritten Hindi line, translates it,

22
00:01:00,375 --> 00:01:03,277
and sorts it into sales, stock and credit,

23
00:01:03,327 --> 00:01:05,492
with a box around every line.

24
00:01:06,642 --> 00:01:08,406
Then Kosha checks her story.

25
00:01:08,456 --> 00:01:11,672
Her wholesaler's bills match the ledger, to the rupee.

26
00:01:11,722 --> 00:01:13,849
UPI shows over ₹8,000 a day.

27
00:01:13,899 --> 00:01:17,114
And months of electricity bills, all paid on time,

28
00:01:17,164 --> 00:01:18,929
prove the shop is real.

29
00:01:19,979 --> 00:01:21,668
Gemini, grounded on Google data,

30
00:01:21,718 --> 00:01:25,148
maps the colleges and bus stops that bring her customers.

31
00:01:25,198 --> 00:01:27,583
Then she answers five questions in Hindi,

32
00:01:27,633 --> 00:01:30,367
and every answer is checked against her documents.

33
00:01:31,517 --> 00:01:34,748
Two minutes later, her credit passport is ready.

34
00:01:34,798 --> 00:01:38,029
A score of 794, and an ₹80,000 offer,

35
00:01:38,079 --> 00:01:42,950
with repayments that rise after Diwali and ease in the lean months.

36
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:45,411
Every reason links to its source.

37
00:01:45,461 --> 00:01:48,692
And Kosha explains it to her, in Hindi.

38
00:01:49,542 --> 00:01:50,592
नमस्ते सुनीता जी।
Namaste, Sunita ji.

39
00:01:51,282 --> 00:01:53,102
आपके अच्छे रिकॉर्ड्स के आधार पर,
Based on your good records,

40
00:01:53,492 --> 00:01:56,882
आपकी दुकान अस्सी हज़ार रुपये तक के ऋण के लिए योग्य है।
your shop qualifies for a loan of up to ₹80,000.

41
00:01:58,592 --> 00:02:00,959
Now meet Nena, in Quezon City.

42
00:02:01,009 --> 00:02:04,586
One of her payment screenshots hides an extra ₱48,000.

43
00:02:04,636 --> 00:02:07,407
Gemini spots digits in a different font,

44
00:02:07,457 --> 00:02:10,227
and the next balance doesn't add up.

45
00:02:10,277 --> 00:02:12,242
No offer, until it's checked.

46
00:02:13,492 --> 00:02:16,800
Shops get fair credit, and a history they own.

47
00:02:16,850 --> 00:02:20,159
Lenders reach customers they could never afford to check,

48
00:02:20,209 --> 00:02:23,144
with less fraud, and decisions they can explain.

49
00:02:23,194 --> 00:02:24,637
Wholesalers sell more stock.

50
00:02:24,687 --> 00:02:26,129
It's free for shops.

51
00:02:26,179 --> 00:02:27,995
Lenders pay per verified passport.

52
00:02:29,245 --> 00:02:32,343
Built on Gemini, Vertex AI and Cloud Run.

53
00:02:32,393 --> 00:02:36,671
Gemini reads the records, and clear, fixed rules make the decision.

54
00:02:36,721 --> 00:02:39,818
Every corner shop has a treasury of trust.

55
00:02:39,868 --> 00:02:42,179
Kosha lets the world see it.
